PROVENANCE "ReviewReducer's nextTileState/nextIndependentSince ladder (SB-8 pilot thresholds): wrong answers demote only from none; correct streaks promote toward none once a tunable threshold is reached. nextStreak is already streak+1 on correct / 0 on wrong, computed natively before this decision."
EXAMPLES disposition
  id | correct | rung | nextStreak | toPartial | toNone -> expected
  wrong-at-none | false | none | 0 | 3 | 5 -> wrong_at_none
  wrong-at-full | false | full | 0 | 3 | 5 -> wrong_at_full
  wrong-at-partial | false | partial | 0 | 3 | 5 -> wrong_at_partial
  promote-full-to-partial | true | full | 3 | 3 | 5 -> promote_full_to_partial
  stay-full-below-threshold | true | full | 2 | 3 | 5 -> stay_full
  promote-partial-to-none | true | partial | 5 | 3 | 5 -> promote_partial_to_none
  stay-partial-below-threshold | true | partial | 4 | 3 | 5 -> stay_partial
  already-hardest | true | none | 1 | 3 | 5 -> already_hardest
END
